---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '@/components/CallToAction.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Wholesale Food Supply Services | Van Harvest Charlotte" description="Explore Van Harvest wholesale supply capabilities, including food catalog support, product sourcing conversations and department-specific customer service." active="/services">
  <section class="inner-hero"><div class="shell inner-grid"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How we support kitchens</p><h1>Supply support<br />with <em>less friction.</em></h1></div><div class="inner-copy reveal"><p>From delivery conversations and account setup to product questions and returns, our team helps foodservice operators keep orders moving.</p><a class="text-link" href="/apply">Apply for an account →</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="services-list">
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual"><span class="service-number">01</span><p>Proteins · Produce · Seafood · Pantry</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Wholesale assortment</span><h2>One catalog for the<br /><em>kitchen and beyond.</em></h2><p>Van Harvest's catalog spans core food categories and the operational essentials that keep a foodservice environment ready.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Fresh & frozen proteins</span><span>Produce & fruit</span><span>Seafood assortment</span><span>Pantry ingredients</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual is-produce"><span class="service-number">02</span><p>Account setup · Terms · Ordering</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Account support</span><h2>Set up your<br /><em>next order.</em></h2><p>New customers can submit an account application. Credit terms, minimums and required documents are shown as confirmation placeholders until Van Harvest provides the final policy.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Apply for an account</span><span>Phone ordering</span><span>SMS / WeChat ordering</span><span>Terms by approval</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual is-gold"><span class="service-number">03</span><p>Delivery · Returns · Questions</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Order care</span><h2>Keep the kitchen<br /><em>moving.</em></h2><p>Talk with the office about delivery planning, substitutions, damaged goods and returns. Final delivery days, cutoff times and return windows will be published after confirmation.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Delivery coordination</span><span>Product questions</span><span>Returns support</span><span>Customer service</span></div></div></article>
  </section>
  <CallToAction />
</BaseLayout>
